> On Thu, Mar 04, 2010 at 04:11:11PM -0500, Chuck Lever wrote:
>> You may be missing some other package, like libgssglue-devel.  Or
>> there could be a bug.  But, nfs-utils should compile and work using
>> --disable-tirpc.
>>
